{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03053","headline":"园中时蔬尽皆锄理唯秋兰数本委而不顾彼虽一物有足悲者遂赋二章 一 · 张九龄","name":"园中时蔬尽皆锄理唯秋兰数本委而不顾彼虽一物有足悲者遂赋二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"场藿已成岁，园葵亦向阳。\n兰时独不偶，露节渐无芳。\n旨异菁爲蓄，甘非蔗有浆。\n人多利一饱，谁复惜馨香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}